    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=Analyze this merged competitor data and return the structured JSON as instructed:\n\n{{ $json.data }}",
        "hasOutputParser": true,
        "options": {
          "systemMessage": "You are a competitor intelligence analyst.\n\nYou will receive raw scraped webpage content from multiple competitor companies, merged together in one input.\n\nTASK:\nAnalyze the content and identify the single most notable change or update — a new product launch, pricing change, campaign, feature release, or similar. If multiple companies have updates, pick the most significant one overall.\n\nOUTPUT RULES (follow exactly):\n1. Return ONLY a single JSON object. Nothing else.\n2. Do NOT include markdown code fences (no ``` symbols).\n3. Do NOT include any explanation, commentary, greeting, or text before or after the JSON.\n4. Do NOT return an array. Return exactly ONE object.\n5. The response must start with the character { and end with the character }.\n6. All four fields are required and must be non-empty strings (except impact, which must be exactly one of: High, Medium, Low).\n\nREQUIRED JSON STRUCTURE:\n{\n  \"company\": \"name of the company\",\n  \"summary\": \"1-2 sentence summary of what changed\",\n  \"impact\": \"High\",\n  \"reason\": \"1 sentence explaining why this impact level was chosen\"\n}\n\nIf the input contains no clear update for any company, still return a valid JSON object with your best assessment — never return an empty response, plain text, or apologies."
        }
      },
      "id": "56c31ba9-c296-477d-b40c-dc5d9217099f",
