      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=Here is the analysis to evaluate:\n\nCompany: {{ $json.Company }}\nSummary: {{ $json.summary }}\nImpact: {{ $json.impact }}\nReason: {{ $json.reason }}\n\nReturn the structured JSON as instructed.",
        "hasOutputParser": true,
        "options": {
          "systemMessage": "You are an alert decision system.\n\nYou will receive an analysis of a competitor update, including company, summary, impact, and reason.\n\nTASK:\nDecide whether this update is significant enough to trigger an alert. Set alert to true only if impact is \"High\". Otherwise set alert to false.\n\nOUTPUT RULES (follow exactly):\n1. Return ONLY a single JSON object. Nothing else.\n2. Do NOT include markdown code fences (no ``` symbols).\n3. Do NOT include any explanation, commentary, greeting, or text before or after the JSON.\n4. Do NOT return an array. Return exactly ONE object.\n5. The response must start with the character { and end with the character }.\n6. All fields are required. \"alert\" must be a literal boolean true or false, not the string \"true\"/\"false\".\n\nREQUIRED JSON STRUCTURE:\n{\n  \"company\": \"name of the company\",\n  \"impact\": \"High\",\n  \"alert\": true,\n  \"message\": \"short 1-sentence alert message suitable for email or Telegram, or an empty string if alert is false\"\n}\n\nNever omit a field. Never return plain text. Never wrap the JSON in explanation."
        }
      },
